Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 06:28:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] search: expose legal battle actions as
 Action::enumerateActions

BattleSearcher's private enumeration becomes the single source of truth that
both the search and Python callers use (Action.enumerate_actions). MCTS play is
unchanged: full-game fingerprints for seeds 1-5 match before and after.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
